.",panelPlaceholder:"What’s on your mind?",panelSend:"Save note",panelNotice:"Notes stay on this site. The cloud trial, 20 prompts, is at /deneme.html.",uploadTitle:"Title",uploadNotes:"Notes",uploadFile:"File",save:"Save",recentUploads:"Recent AI uploads",payEyebrow:"The workspace",payTitle:"Usage & payments.",payIntro:"1 USD = 10 credits. A Q5 prompt costs 1 credit. A Q8 prompt costs 2 credits. Recording a prompt spends credits. The virtual POS does not charge a card.",rateLine:"1 USD = 10 credits.",q5Line:"A Q5 prompt costs 1 credit.",q8Line:"A Q8 prompt costs 2 credits.",balanceLabel:"Credit balance",modelLabel:"Prompt",promptLabel:"Prompt text",recordPrompt:"Record prompt",promptSaved:"Prompt recorded. Credits were deducted. No card was charged.",needCredits:"Not enough credits. The prompt was not recorded, and no card was charged.",payBlocked:"No live merchant is connected. The virtual POS records not_charged and does not use Test Payment. A real charge needs Demir to connect Paysera with a project ID, project password, and website ownership code for https://kanus.org. Nothing here charges a card.",merchant:"Merchant contact",promptsEmpty:"No prompts recorded yet.",creditsUnit:"credits",bookTitle:"Make time.",bookIntro:"Request a conversation. This stores the request. It does not bill a calendar.",bookName:"Name",bookEmail:"Email",bookWhen:"When",bookNote:"Note",bookSave:"Request time",newsTitle:"The journal.",newsIntro:"News and notes from the workspace.",newsEmpty:"Nothing here just yet.",compose:"New entry",newsBody:"Body",galTitle:"The gallery.",galIntro:"A visual space for new perspectives.",caption:"Caption",snapTitle:"Snapshots.",snapIntro:"Named captures kept with the gallery.",note:"Note",forumTitle:"Forum.",forumIntro:"Start a topic or leave a reply. No password is asked for or stored.",author:"Display name",topicTitle:"Title",topicBody:"Body",newTopic:"New topic",reply:"Reply",noTopics:"No topics yet.",contactEyebrow:"Stay in the loop",contactTitle: